    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u201cRISE FROM YOUR BED...\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That\u2019s how V\u2019s nightmare begins: a stressed-out mom and wife, woken by a mysterious voice and dragged into a cursed videogame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now she must beat any foe unlucky enough to cross her path and escape a crazy low-poly world inhabited by strange creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s only one way out: hit everything. With a frying pan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/50e23d7e75ddc5180026e161082a8fa1.poster.avif?t=1752342206\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/50e23d7e75ddc5180026e161082a8fa1.webm?t=1752342206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/50e23d7e75ddc5180026e161082a8fa1.mp4?t=1752342206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MANY GENRES. ZERO MERCY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">V\u2019s Rage is a hand-drawn arcade adventure inspired by the great arcade classics of the \u201980s and \u201990s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expect frantic combat, absurd enemies, and gameplay rules that change with every stage. Each level throws you into a new experience: Beat \u2019em up, Shoot \u2019em up, Run and Gun, Side-scroller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn, fail, swear, repeat. No tutorials, no guidance. Just pure, classic arcade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/1e9804e88acfedbceb02bef3d126aac4.poster.avif?t=1752342206\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/1e9804e88acfedbceb02bef3d126aac4.webm?t=1752342206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/1e9804e88acfedbceb02bef3d126aac4.mp4?t=1752342206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BETWEEN ARCADE CABINETS AND \u201980s ANIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">V\u2019s Rage is rooted in the spirit of old-school coin-ops like Final Fight, Altered Beast, and Parodius.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Its visual style is a hand-drawn explosion of \u201980s anime energy, a nostalgic tribute to iconic characters like <i>Lum</i> and <i>Ranma</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/dfa7de125fcca5a4ad829b1f8de056ca.poster.avif?t=1752342206\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/dfa7de125fcca5a4ad829b1f8de056ca.webm?t=1752342206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/dfa7de125fcca5a4ad829b1f8de056ca.mp4?t=1752342206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u201cRISE FROM YOUR BED...\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That\u2019s how V\u2019s nightmare begins: a stressed-out mom and wife, woken by a mysterious voice and dragged into a cursed videogame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now she must beat any foe unlucky enough to cross her path and escape a crazy low-poly world inhabited by strange creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s only one way out: hit everything. With a frying pan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/50e23d7e75ddc5180026e161082a8fa1.poster.avif?t=1752342206\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/50e23d7e75ddc5180026e161082a8fa1.webm?t=1752342206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/50e23d7e75ddc5180026e161082a8fa1.mp4?t=1752342206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MANY GENRES. ZERO MERCY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">V\u2019s Rage is a hand-drawn arcade adventure inspired by the great arcade classics of the \u201980s and \u201990s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expect frantic combat, absurd enemies, and gameplay rules that change with every stage. Each level throws you into a new experience: Beat \u2019em up, Shoot \u2019em up, Run and Gun, Side-scroller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn, fail, swear, repeat. No tutorials, no guidance. Just pure, classic arcade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/1e9804e88acfedbceb02bef3d126aac4.poster.avif?t=1752342206\" ><source src=\"https